dialogs
0	This POKéMON won the BEAUTY CONTEST here before.Well, guess what? Today, I made it win a SMARTNESS CONTEST!My abilities scare even me…
1	I've entered a bunch of CONTESTS, so I'm seeing how things work.If you're in a COOLNESS CONTEST, cool moves go over as appeals.But smart moves and cute moves don't go over well, for instance.
2	That young man who won earlier had a whole bunch of different S.Can you win if you had that many of those things?
3	MC: Okay, SMART POKéMON and their TRAINERS, are you ready?!Give it your best showing! Let's appeal!
4	JUDGE: Are you enjoying this CONTEST?Come back with three friends, and all of you may enter a CONTEST!
5	Ayayayay… I entered the wrong CONTEST.I entered this tough POKéMON in the SMARTNESS CONTEST…Come on, wow them with a smart-looking ROCK SMASH.
6	I've spent many a year, and all my wisdom besides, raising this POKéMON to be smart.It won't be easily bested by some young pup's POKéMON.My dear wife, are you seeing this?
7	There it is!If my POKéMON pulls a smart move next, the audience's excitement will peak!
8	Oh, dear, no!My darling ZUBAT's LEECH LIFE is so cute I kept using it over and over!But these mean people don't appreciate it at all!
9	Kiyaaah! You're beautiful, Grandpa!
10	When all's said and done, I still love SMARTNESS CONTESTS.That intellectual green color… It's so… So… Cool.
11	Even when TRAINERS enter the same kind of POKéMON, they all seem to use different moves for appeals.It's just like the way people have different styles for battling.
